<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche Q1 sales up 18 pct to 4.45 bln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Roche Q1 sales up 18 pct to 4.45 bln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter of 1997 compared with first quarter of 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    4,450	     vs 3,785</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p> Pharmaceuticals division   2,886	     vs 2,430</p>
<p> Vitamins, fine chemicals   934		 vs 792</p>
<p> Diagnostics		    223		 vs 174</p>
<p> Fragrances and flavours    407		 vs 387</p>
<p> Others			   zero		vs 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Roche Holding AG. The company said in a statement first quarter sales rose 18 percent in Swiss franc terms and three percent in local currencies.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
